{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T05:46:27.378Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019fd59b-d4b1-7153-a210-0a0277335c3b","call_id":"call_A9uE9T3Se7eVsgqNVBELu1Pn","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Rebasing (1/1)\rSuccessfully rebased and updated refs/heads/codex/trace-staging-request-latency.\n## codex/trace-staging-request-latency\n7fa7df2cd72 (HEAD -> codex/trace-staging-request-latency) perf: trace staging request latency\n0fdcf9d080e (codex/full-application-simplification-review) docs: record application review checkpoint\n✓ Switched to codex/full-application-simplification-review\nStack: (main) <- codex/remove-prior-compliance-artifacts <- codex/remove-dead-runtime-dependencies <- codex/remove-legacy-migration-tools <- codex/remove-tenant-migration-steps <- codex/remove-identity-migration-steps <- codex/remove-event-migration-steps <- codex/remove-legacy-event-mapping-rules <- codex/remove-migration-support-utilities <- codex/remove-migration-repository-wiring <- codex/remove-legacy-schema-module <- codex/remove-legacy-schema-history <- codex/remove-generated-legacy-snapshot <- codex/remove-invalid-types-alias <- codex/guard-local-drizzle-targets <- codex/require-explicit-seed-context <- codex/fail-closed-local-seeding <- codex/reuse-primary-provider-credentials <- codex/harden-brand-asset-storage <- codex/use-production-shaped-tenant-fixtures <- codex/fail-closed-local-runtime-state <- codex/harden-container-runtime-image <- codex/enforce-registration-graph-integrity <- codex/settle-registration-addons-in-one-checkout <- codex/define-registration-transfer-claim-rules <- codex/harden-transfer-refund-recovery <- codex/guard-transfer-acquisition-data <- codex/remove-direct-registration-reassignment <- codex/use-private-registration-transfer-claims <- codex/add-private-transfer-claim-interface <- codex/attach-organization-payment-account <- cod