{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T06:45:57.439Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_044b9c7c4d3e7db0016a742da4171c8191a55afe94805a33b4","status":"completed","call_id":"call_e4MuqznS7uHHPQz5DPWicwaU","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\"cmd\":\"gh pr view 123 --json number,title,body,isDraft,headRefName,baseRefName,url,state,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup && gh pr view 124 --json number,title,body,isDraft,headRefName,baseRefName,url,state,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":20000});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T06:45:59.338Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019fd5d2-55aa-7592-a6f6-563011590f7c","call_id":"call_e4MuqznS7uHHPQz5DPWicwaU","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.9 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Purpose\\n\\nComplete the full manual application review and simplification program against current `main`. The durable ledger is `APPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md`: **155 findings** (**153 resolved, 2 accepted with explicit boundaries, none awaiting a product decision**) and **41 complexity candidates** (**38 simplified, 3 retained with explicit boundaries**).\\n\\n## Product and application scope\\n\\n- implements the settled waitlist, private transfer, event discovery, announcement visibility, focused settings, routed profile, and combined registration/add-on Checkout directions;\\n- derives ordinary published-event discovery from current registration-option eligibility, while optionless announcements use a separate selected-organization-role visibility list; discovery never grants access and direct-link ineligibility remains explicit;\\n- allows one Stripe payment account to serve multiple organizations intentionally, without a cross-organization uniqueness lookup, constraint, or compatibility path; members, events, settings, authority, and payment records remain organization-scoped;\\n- removes obsolete audience configuration, participant direct reassignment, payment-account rotation, old-schema compatibility, speculative frameworks, retry loops, and fallbacks that hid defects;\\n- adds the new Evorto Material theme as the default while retaining Classic and ESN;\\n- replaces implementation terminology in screens, emails, public errors, and generated guides with plain task, outcome, and next-action language;\\n- hardens registration limits, transfers, Checkout, refunds, cancellation state, tenant isolation, platform authority, uploads, configuration, and deployment boundaries.\\n\\n## Provider-backed guide publication\\n\\nThe official publication now passes from the source journeys and updates the companion [Pages PR #15](https://github.com/heddendorp/evorto/pull/15). Local guide runs may reuse only the three missing provider values needed for ESNcard and Google Maps from the primary checkout; the current environment always wins, no database/Auth0/Stripe credentials are imported, values are never printed, and absent inputs still fail visibly.\\n\\nA final visual review found and fixed the first-steps image at its source: it now captures only a neutral email field and exposes no test-environment branding. No generated-page patch, compatibility alias, partial bundle, retry, or stale output was used.\\n\\n## Docker and local verification stability\\n\\n- removed the problematic worktree-file bind from PostgreSQL automatic initialization and made disposable database setup explicit and fail-closed;\\n- verified two clean empty-volume starts plus stop/resume behavior without rerunning one-shot setup;\\n- established the required lifecycle: the persistent worktree stack and disposable Playwright stack run serially, then PostgreSQL is recreated for its own suite and stopped afterward;\\n- traced the earlier image-build failure to concurrent heavy builds exhausting Docker Desktop memory; the isolated serial image build and security gate pass;\\n- left the unrelated local Docker project untouched and healthy.\\n\\n## Schema and runtime impact\\n\\n- targets the fresh schema directly; no runtime migration, legacy import, compatibility alias, or backfill is added;\\n- removes ordinary event/template audience state and unsupported Stripe account rotation paths;\\n- keeps Stripe authoritative for payment state and surfaces ambiguous side effects for review rather than retrying them automatically;\\n- changes local Compose initialization only; production schema application remains the existing Drizzle/Scaleway release path.\\n\\n## Verification on the final committed tree\\n\\n- frozen install, formatting, lint, diff check, production app/operations build, release validation: passed;\\n- Angular: **144 files / 1,106 tests**;\\n- server: **199 files / 1,603 tests**;\\n- PostgreSQL 17: **17 files / 83 tests**;\\n- functional Playwright: **153/153**, no failures, skips, retries, or incomplete tests;\\n- integration Playwright: **11/11**;\\n- live ESNcard release certification: **8 focused unit checks + 9 provider-backed journeys**;\\n- generated documentation: **54/54**, publishing **13 guides / 199 assets** with all references complete;\\n- companion Pages branch: **19/19** tooling tests, lint, diff check, and **23-page** production build;\\n- Terraform bootstrap/production/staging and infrastructure checks: zero misconfigurations;\\n- linux/amd64 runtime image: **95,726,857 bytes**, runtime source maps absent and exported separately, **0 vulnerabilities**;\\n- branch-authentic Browser acceptance: passed for the reviewed public and signed-in flows.\\n\\nThe earlier user-cancelled standalone scan was not restarted. This PR is ready for review and should not be merged by automation.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"codex/full-application-simplification-review\",\"isDraft\":false,\"number\":123,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:37:05Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016029618/job/92340184007\",\"name\":\"Analyze (actions)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:17Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:21Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016035000/job/92340193966\",\"name\":\"Display the branch stack\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:13Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Git Town\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:22Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016036517/job/92340199400\",\"name\":\"Knope and change files\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:14Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:37:37Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016036517/job/92340199592\",\"name\":\"PostgreSQL integration tests\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:21Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:42:27Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016036517/job/92340199453\",\"name\":\"Lint, unit tests, and build\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:21Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:47Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016036517/job/92340199664\",\"name\":\"Terraform validation and static scan\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:14Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:40:50Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016036517/job/92340199471\",\"name\":\"Linux image, SBOM, vulnerabilities, and size\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:14Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:42:32Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/31016036517/job/92342025570\",\"name\":\"CI/gate\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:42:30Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:58Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/runs/92340411720\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:55Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:36:23Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:37:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://knope.tech\",\"name\":\"Require changes to be documented\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-05T14:37:01Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"refactor: complete application simplification review\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/pull/123\"}\n{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Purpose\\n\\nMake the post-cold staging latency defect measurable at the server boundaries and from an independent external vantage, without masking the known breach as a cold-start problem.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- add stable Effect/OpenTelemetry spans for auth-session loading, request-context and tenant/user resolution, SSR, Angular rendering, Effect RPC methods, and the event-list database query;\\n- keep trace attributes bounded and non-sensitive (authentication state, pagination, result counts, and stable operation names only);\\n- add a dependency-free `/events` latency probe with per-sample DNS/connect/TLS/TTFB/total timings, Envoy upstream time, status/content validation, revision, and image digest;\\n- run four warm-candidate samples independently every 15 minutes and retain report evidence for seven days;\\n- attach a separate ten-sample report-only baseline to changed staging deployments and their immutable manifest;\\n- document improvement order, provisional budgets, dashboards, alert activation, and incident triage.\\n\\n## Runtime, schema, and UI impact\\n\\n- No database schema change.\\n- No user-interface behavior change.\\n- Latency thresholds remain report-only while the known defect is open; status or invalid-content failures still fail immediately, and a manual dispatch can exercise critical enforcement.\\n- The existing Effect OpenTelemetry exporter is reused; no competing telemetry pipeline is introduced.\\n\\n## Current staging evidence\\n\\nA live probe on 2026-07-27 against deployed revision `d117229d3d7d357af9f9fc61fdad8d348d6809ea` classified the warm path as `warning`:\\n\\n- upstream service time: p50 813 ms, p95/max 1,045 ms;\\n- external TTFB: p50 929.8 ms, p95/max 1,209.74 ms;\\n- zero HTTP or application-content failures.\\n\\nThis confirms that the post-start path remains slow and provides the baseline this PR is intended to preserve.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\nPassed on commit `c60092211dbe04a47098b6cbf559c634de8bb718`:\\n\\n- `bun install --frozen-lockfile`\\n- `bun run release:validate`\\n- `bun run format:write`\\n- `bun run format:check`\\n- `bun run lint`\\n- clean working-tree checks\\n- `bun run test:unit:server` — 1,454 tests\\n- `bun run test:unit` — 802 tests\\n- `bun run test:integration:postgres:local` — 55 tests on PostgreSQL 17\\n- `bun run build:app`\\n- `bun run infra:check` — valid Terraform, zero misconfigurations\\n- `bun run image:security:local` — zero detected image vulnerabilities\\n- `actionlint`, `shellcheck`, `bash -n`, and focused probe/telemetry tests\\n\\nNot run by explicit request because another E2E execution is currently active elsewhere:\\n\\n- `bun run test:e2e`\\n- `bun run test:e2e:docs`\\n\\n* `main` <!-- branch-stack -->\\n  - **feat: add staging latency observability** :point\\\\_left:\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\\n\\n- **New Features**\\n  - Added automated staging latency monitoring every 15 minutes, with on-demand checks and optional critical-threshold enforcement.\\n  - Deployment evidence now includes warm-latency reports and summaries for changed staging deployments.\\n  - Added comprehensive guidance for monitoring, diagnosing, and improving warm-path performance.\\n\\n- **Observability**\\n  - Expanded request tracing and latency metrics across server rendering, authentication, context resolution, RPCs, and event-list queries.\\n\\n- **Tests**\\n  - Added coverage for latency reporting, threshold enforcement, deployment evidence, and trace visibility.\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"codex/staging-latency-runbooks\",\"isDraft\":false,\"number\":124,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:52:31Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272257428/job/89997464696\",\"name\":\"Analyze (actions)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:40Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:48Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272263402/job/89997475641\",\"name\":\"Display the branch stack\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:42Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Git Town\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:46Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272260607/job/89997465417\",\"name\":\"Knope and change files\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:40Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:52:49Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272260607/job/89997465409\",\"name\":\"PostgreSQL integration tests\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:40Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:57:10Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272260607/job/89997465360\",\"name\":\"Lint, unit tests, and build\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:41Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:58Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272260607/job/89997465395\",\"name\":\"Terraform validation and static scan\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:40Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:56:32Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272260607/job/89997465463\",\"name\":\"Linux image, SBOM, vulnerabilities, and size\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:41Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:57:16Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/actions/runs/30272260607/job/89998969601\",\"name\":\"CI/gate\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:57:14Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"PR Quality\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:52:24Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/runs/89997661839\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:52:21Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:52:17Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:35Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://knope.tech\",\"name\":\"Require changes to be documented\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-27T13:51:35Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"feat: add staging latency observability\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/evorto-app/app/pull/124\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
