{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T08:15:30.506Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"I found and closed an important compliance gap before any remote update: this repository’s own mandatory PR baseline is broader than the seven code gates. Because every draft PR triggers the unfiltered quality workflow—and the documented baseline explicitly adds functional and documentation Playwright—the exact PostgreSQL, infrastructure, image-security, functional Playwright, and documentation Playwright commands must also pass on every one of the 99 heads. I’m adding that per-head phase rather than relying on one green final tip; the existing code audit remains useful and continues unchanged.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
