{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T10:26:54.362Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The first exact branch stopped at the server-unit gate, but this does not look like a branch defect: the same head had already completed all 1,451 server tests in 52 seconds, while the second run spent 17 minutes, timed out one test, and could not start two workers. I’m treating that as a setup/resource failure, identifying the contention first, and will only rerun once the cause is removed; no Docker stack was left behind.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
