{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T11:02:17.898Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The Docker restart did resolve the engine hang. The latest run reached a healthy isolated PostgreSQL instance, then stopped because the test harness omitted the repository’s explicit local-reset confirmation variable. That is a harness configuration error—not an application failure—so I’m correcting the harness and restarting the exact branch-head checks from the beginning.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
