{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T11:02:18.291Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019fd6bc-ffb3-7160-b934-3600884272c7","author":"/root/branch_gate_audit_1_27","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/branch_gate_audit_1_27\nPayload:\nAttempt 4 stopped at `postgres_db_reset`; no retry.\n\nCause: `REDACTED` was not supplied, so the destructive-reset safety guard rejected `bun run db:reset`.\n\nBefore failure, head 1 passed:\n\n- Server units: 182 files / 1,451 tests\n- App units: 111 files / 802 tests\n- PostgreSQL startup: healthy in 6 seconds\n\nArtifacts are checksum-verified at `/tmp/evorto-full-baseline-1-27.xuvFj0/attempt-4-full-retry/`. The isolated database remains healthy and untouched; all harness locks/processes were cleaned up."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
