{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T11:45:53.032Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"One constraint I’m checking before rebuilding is the stack service’s own maximum size. The reviewable split plan grows the stack from 100 to 127 layers; I’m verifying that the GitHub stack API accepts that so we don’t produce a locally tidy structure that cannot be submitted as one stack.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
