{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:17:36.650Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_044b9c7c4d3e7db0016a747b5b66048191bc3b2886afdc8fd4","status":"completed","call_id":"call_Nqn4xCaxR3JKsFsHg7X2zns0","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"rg -n \\\"email outbox|Email Outbox|sent rows|sent.*overview|delivery.*sent|outbox\\\" PRODUCT.md APPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md ARCHITECTURE.md src/app/global-admin/email-outbox src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/global-admin.handlers.ts src/shared/rpc-contracts/app-rpcs/global-admin.rpcs.ts tests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts | head -240\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto\",\n  yield_time_ms: 10000,\n  max_output_tokens: 30000\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:17:37.051Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019fd701-f31b-7ba3-9cb2-e9464593beaa","call_id":"call_Nqn4xCaxR3JKsFsHg7X2zns0","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"tests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:9:} from '../../support/utils/email-outbox-scenario';\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:18:const outboxRow = (page: Page, item: EmailOutboxScenarioItem) =>\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:42:**Email delivery** shows recent messages for every organization. It tells you whether each message is waiting, being sent, could not be sent, was sent, could not be confirmed, or was not sent because the address cannot receive organization emails. The page does not show message contents or offer a resend action.\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:76:    const unknownRow = outboxRow(page, scenario.unknown);\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:77:    const sendingRow = outboxRow(page, scenario.sending);\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:78:    const failedRow = outboxRow(page, scenario.failed);\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:85:      'Evorto is sending this message. If delivery cannot be confirmed, it will not be sent again.',\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:98:      page.locator('app-email-outbox'),\ntests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts:131:    await expect(outboxRow(page, scenario.unknown)).toContainText(\nPRODUCT.md:529:separate from transactional delivery: templates enter the durable outbox and\nPRODUCT.md:532:After automatic delivery exhausts its retry budget, the outbox row remains\nARCHITECTURE.md:289:the transactional outbox before delivery through the configured provider. Do\nARCHITECTURE.md:290:not bypass the outbox for template rendering, delivery, idempotency, retries, or\nARCHITECTURE.md:293:An exhausted outbox row remains stored and read-only. The current product does\nsrc/server/effect/rpc/handlers/global-admin.handlers.ts:45:} from '../../../notifications/email-outbox-lease';\nsrc/server/effect/rpc/handlers/global-admin.handlers.ts:494:    'deliveryUnknown' | 'failed' | 'queued' | 'sending' | 'sent' | 'suppressed';\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:89:| RQ-008 | In progress    | Receipt, reimbursement, object-storage, email-outbox, worker, and failure-visibility behavior has source and database-free proof                                                                    | Final receipt/email PostgreSQL tests and credentialed finance journeys                                                                        |\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:113:| RQ-008 | Finance and notifications   | Receipts, storage, reimbursements, email outbox, failure visibility                    | Complete | Tenant/platform finance, object storage, outbox, provider, and worker paths traced                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:215:| F-043 | Medium   | Email-outbox overview can displace old unresolved incidents with newer routine rows                                                | Cursor/status filtering or unresolved-first ordering                                             | Resolved                                                                                 |\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:313:| F-138 | Low      | The email overview completeness helper treated any `sent` row admitted by its contract as incomplete and no longer selected `sentAt`; although the current detail query excludes sent rows, this latent contract and mapping mismatch could falsely alert if that selection changes  | Select the delivery time, and classify a sent record as incomplete only when that time is missing; prove both complete and incomplete sent records directly                                                                                                                | Resolved: the overview mapping carries `sentAt`, applies the exact invariant, and its focused handler suite passes 21/21                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:366:| C-017 | Email outbox forwarding layers                                             | Stored sender fields are never read and a one-method operations service only forwards                                                                                                      | Delete fields/service; keep one delivery boundary                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  | Strong          | Resolved                                                                                                                                                                                                    |\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:369:| C-020 | User profile mega-component                                                | Inactive sections mounted event, card, and receipt queries; unrelated account concerns still share one route shell                                                                         | Retain a small shared profile shell, move substantial areas to routed pages that own their query/mutation state, and replace the sparse overview with a meaningful landing page; do not add presentational-only wrappers                                                                                                                           | Worth exploring | Resolved: overview, events, discounts, and receipts are routed pages that own their queries; the shared shell contains only navigation and provider-aware visibility                                        |\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:455:- outbox producer idempotency and hosted recipient/provider fail-closed checks;\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:646:  `email_outbox_dispatch_idx`, and ordinary event discovery used the current\nAPPLICATION_REVIEW_QUEUE.md:650:  outbox rows, so no additional scale index is claimed or added.\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:7:    [disabled]=\"outboxQuery.isRefetching()\"\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:8:    (click)=\"outboxQuery.refetch()\"\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:15:@if (outboxQuery.isPending()) {\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:21:} @else if (outboxQuery.isError()) {\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:26:} @else if (outboxQuery.isSuccess()) {\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:27:  @let overview = outboxQuery.data();\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html:82:              Emails with unconfirmed delivery are not sent again, which avoids\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.ts:36:  selector: 'app-email-outbox',\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.ts:37:  templateUrl: './email-outbox.component.html',\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.ts:45:  protected readonly outboxQuery = injectQuery(() =>\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.spec.ts:14:} from './email-outbox.component';\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.spec.ts:61:                    queryKey: ['global-admin', 'email-outbox'],\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.spec.ts:78:  it('uses plain delivery language for a message waiting to be sent', async () => {\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.spec.ts:120:      expect(text).not.toContain('outbox');\nsrc/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.spec.ts:176:        'Evorto is sending this message. If delivery cannot be confirmed, it will not be sent again.',\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
