{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:21:39.522Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019fd705-a642-7710-8904-301e5b05bbb7","call_id":"call_pD3ZPYU03JWlqGIcQLvRDwr6","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_1_27\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Attempt 6 stopped without retry at exact head 1.\\n\\n- `bun run test:unit:server` exited 1 after 1,033s.\\n- 181 files / 1,441 tests passed; no assertion failed.\\n- Vitest failed to start the worker for `src/server/context/tenant-schema.spec.ts`: `Timeout waiting for worker to respond`.\\n- This matches the earlier worker-starvation class; the same head previously passed 182 files / 1,451 tests in 74.38s.\\n- E2E was not reached. The harness nevertheless proved `APP_HOST_PORT=4200` and `BASE_URL=http://localhost:4200`; canonical commands remained unchanged.\\n- No Docker residue, host lock, or port-4200 listener remains. The clone is clean at exact head 1, and the prior diagnostic evidence still verifies.\\n\\nArtifacts: [SUMMARY.md](/tmp/evorto-full-baseline-1-27.xuvFj0/attempt-6-app-host-port-4200/SUMMARY.md), [unit log](/tmp/evorto-full-baseline-1-27.xuvFj0/attempt-6-app-host-port-4200/logs/001_unit_server.log), [failure.json](/tmp/evorto-full-baseline-1-27.xuvFj0/attempt-6-app-host-port-4200/failure.json), [checksums](/tmp/evorto-full-baseline-1-27.xuvFj0/attempt-6-app-host-port-4200/artifact-sha256.txt).\\n\\n\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/branch_gate_audit_28_54\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"All four commits require splitting; none merits a cohesive exception. New branch names were locally checked as available. Inspection was read-only; no tests or mutations were performed.\\n\\n## Position 70 — `199b2176`\\n\\nTotal: 1,259 changed lines. Mandatory two-way whole-file split; no hunk split.\\n\\n1. `codex/receipt-reimbursements-ui`  \\n   `refactor: simplify platform finance review flows`  \\n   610 lines\\n\\n   - Rename both reimbursement-confirmation dialog component/spec files from `src/app/global-admin/platform-tenant-admin/` to `src/app/finance/shared/reimbursement-confirmation-dialog/`.\\n   - `src/app/global-admin/platform-tenant-admin/platform-finance.component.html`\\n   - `src/app/global-admin/platform-tenant-admin/platform-finance.component.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/app/global-admin/platform-tenant-admin/platform-finance.component.ts`\\n\\n2. `codex/receipt-reimbursements-api`  \\n   `refactor: harden receipt reimbursement boundaries`  \\n   649 lines\\n\\n   - `.changeset/simplify-receipt-reimbursements.md`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/platform/platform-tenant-finance.handlers.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/platform/platform-tenant-finance.handlers.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/rpc-contracts/app-rpcs/platform-tenant-finance.rpcs.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/rpc-contracts/app-rpcs/platform-tenant-finance.rpcs.ts`\\n\\nOrder is mandatory: the UI first adopts the already-existing detail RPC; the API child can then remove evidence/preview fields from queue records without breaking the consumer.\\n\\nLater generated-doc and Playwright corrections for the changed labels must be consolidated into child 1, especially `generated-docs-source.spec.ts`, platform-tenant operations, registration-cancellation, and registration-transfer coverage. The stated totals cover only this commit’s diff.\\n\\n## Position 73 — `1da541a9`\\n\\nTotal: 1,045 changed lines. Mandatory three-way split with an additive compatibility bridge.\\n\\n1. `codex/email-outbox-overview-ui`  \\n   `refactor: clarify email delivery overview`  \\n   398 lines\\n\\n   Whole files:\\n\\n   - `src/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.html`\\n   - `src/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/app/global-admin/email-outbox/email-outbox.component.ts`\\n\\n   Required hunks:\\n\\n   - Add `recordIncomplete` to `global-admin.rpcs.ts`, retaining all legacy fields and summary counts.\\n   - Add `recordIncomplete: false` to the RPC fixture.\\n   - Add `emailDeliveryRecordIncomplete` and its mapper field in `global-admin.handlers.ts`, retaining the old query/projection.\\n\\n2. `codex/email-outbox-overview-contract`  \\n   `refactor: minimize email delivery overview records`  \\n   400 lines\\n\\n   Whole files:\\n\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/global-admin.handlers.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/notifications/email-outbox-lease.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/notifications/email-outbox-lease.ts`\\n\\n   Required hunks:\\n\\n   - Remaining overview-query/projection changes in `global-admin.handlers.ts`.\\n   - Remaining field/count deletions in both global-admin RPC files.\\n   - Only the `emailOutboxStaleSendingPredicate` → `emailOutboxAbandonedSendingPredicate` import/call changes in `email-delivery.ts`.\\n\\n3. `codex/email-outbox-single-dispatch-schema`  \\n   `refactor: remove obsolete email outbox fields`  \\n   247 lines\\n\\n   Whole files:\\n\\n   - `.changeset/simplify-email-outbox.md`\\n   - `helpers/testing/email-outbox-kind-source.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/db/schema/email-outbox.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/db/schema/email-outbox.ts`\\n   - `src/server/http/worker-email-delivery.route.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/notifications/email-delivery.postgres.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/notifications/email-delivery.spec.ts`\\n\\n   Required hunk:\\n\\n   - Remaining `email-delivery.ts` changes removing persisted sender/exhaustion fields.\\n\\nOrder is bridge UI → minimized RPC projection → storage contraction. Effect RPC typing makes reversing the first two unsafe.\\n\\nOutstanding blockers:\\n\\n- Consolidate later updates to `tests/support/utils/email-outbox-scenario.ts`, `tests/specs/admin/email-outbox.spec.ts`, and `tests/docs/admin/email-outbox.doc.ts`.\\n- The schema contraction needs an expand/data-normalization/contract release sequence; directly dropping columns and adding the attempts constraint is not compatible with existing rows or a briefly running prior release.\\n- Production excludes `sent` rows from the overview query despite new code/tests handling that status; resolve that discrepancy.\\n\\n## Position 76 — `335d8728`\\n\\nTotal: 1,093 changed lines. Mandatory three-way split; the first two children split three newly added files by hunk.\\n\\n1. `codex/profile-event-payment-overview`  \\n   `feat: add profile event payment overview`  \\n   Approximately 450 lines\\n\\n   No whole files. In the three `profile-events.component.*` files, take:\\n\\n   - Base event-card UI, loading/error handling, status, audience, guest/add-on, payment, pass, check-in, next-step, and safe Stripe continuation behavior.\\n   - TypeScript helpers through `profileEventContinuePaymentUrl`, plus payment/status labels and the component without action/refund bindings.\\n   - Matching tests, retaining only the audience/pass assertions from the organizer/helper test.\\n\\n2. `codex/profile-event-actions-and-refunds`  \\n   `feat: explain profile event actions and refunds`  \\n   Approximately 372 lines\\n\\n   No whole files. Add the remaining hunks:\\n\\n   - `UsersEventSummaryRecord`/`ProfileEventRefund` typing.\\n   - `profileEventActionNote`.\\n   - Refund source/state labels.\\n   - HTML refund block and action-note paragraph.\\n   - Action, organizer/helper-action, cancellation, and refund tests.\\n   - Corresponding component bindings.\\n\\n   Final-file coordinates are:\\n\\n   - TypeScript: lines 1–2, 14–15, 88–192, 232–254, 270, and 279–282.\\n   - HTML: lines 78–92 and 116–118.\\n   - Spec: action/refund imports; lines 34–117, 125–148, and 270–375.\\n\\n3. `codex/profile-pages-routing-shell`  \\n   `refactor: route focused profile pages`  \\n   271 lines\\n\\n   Whole files:\\n\\n   - `.changeset/route-profile-pages.md`\\n   - `src/app/profile/profile-shell/profile-shell.component.html`\\n   - `src/app/profile/profile-shell/profile-shell.component.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/app/profile/profile-shell/profile-shell.component.ts`\\n   - `src/app/profile/profile.routes.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/app/profile/profile.routes.ts`\\n\\nOrder is overview → action/refund completion → routing. The route child must remain last so no intermediate route exposes an incomplete page.\\n\\n## Position 80 — `c94c15fe`\\n\\nTotal: 1,242 changed lines. Mandatory three-way split with one four-line invariant hunk.\\n\\n1. `codex/role-targeted-event-discovery-core`  \\n   `feat: enforce role-targeted event discovery`  \\n   494 lines\\n\\n   Whole files:\\n\\n   - `src/db/schema/event-instances.ts`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/events/events-lifecycle.handlers.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/events/events-lifecycle.handlers.ts`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/events/events-query.handlers.ts`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/events/events.handlers.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/effect/rpc/handlers/roles.handlers.ts`\\n   - `src/server/roles/tenant-role-graph.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/server/roles/tenant-role-graph.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/event-discovery.spec.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/event-discovery.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/permissions/permissions.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/rpc-contracts/app-rpcs/events.errors.ts`\\n   - `src/shared/rpc-contracts/app-rpcs/events.rpcs.ts`\\n\\n   Required hunk from `platform-events.handlers.ts`: the four added lines that clear `announcementRoleIds` when either the prior or updated event has registration options.\\n\\n2. `codex/role-targeted-event-discovery-tenant-ui`  \\n   `feat: manage role-targeted event discovery`  \\n   421 lines\\n\\n   - `.changeset/target-information-events-by-role.md`\\n   - Three `src/app/events/event-details/event-details.component.*` files\\n   - Three `src/app/events/update-announcement-discovery-dialog/update-announcement-discovery-dialog.component.*` files\\n\\n3. `codex/role-targeted-event-discovery-platform-ui`  \\n   `feat: administer role-targeted event discovery`  \\n   327 lines\\n\\n   